# @cykrome/* (the CyKrome SDK) comes from GitHub Packages. The token (read:packages) is not kept
# here: pnpm only reads it from user config or the environment, e.g. in ~/.npmrc
#   //npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
# CI gets it from actions/setup-node (registry-url) and the CYKROME_PACKAGES_TOKEN secret.
@cykrome:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
